 kid I love movie posters I  love car artwork I have I would say  hundreds if not thousands of different  pieces of memorabilia in the house  [Music]  wouldn't it be cool if you could just  live in something everyday that you love  so much you had a passion for it's like  you know if you were a fan of a sports  team you could just build that stadium  and just live in it all day long you  know what I mean so that's the feeling I  get every time then I'm here I'm living  in my favorite movie every single day  I've lived in Myers house like there  it's an incredible feeling I've been  here over a decade I don't think I could  ever walk away from this home I really  don't I mean it's funny but I have  reoccurring nightmares that I don't live  in this house like I'll pull down the  driveway and it's not there I just don't  think I could ever walk away from this  house I love it too much it means too  much to me  [Music]

